'''Yakisoba Face''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Nissin U.F.O. Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Yakisoba Face
|image = E 509.png
|appearance = [[Nissin U.F.O. Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 2,000円 - 7,900円
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy acts as support for the many [[Yakisoba U.F.O. Cat (Enemy)|Yakisoba U.F.O. Cats]] found in U.F.O. Corps Strikes!. He can [[Warp|warp]] cats backwards from a range of 500.

==Strategy==
Since Yakisoba Face is mainly used as support, [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance Cats]] or [[:Category:Cats with Warp Immunity|Cats with Warp Immunity]] are both good for attacking him behind enemy frontlines and negating its effect respectively.

Alternatively, you could wait for the right timing and use units such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] to effectively land hits on him before getting attacked, though in order for this to work, you'll first have to clear the Yakisoba U.F.O. Cats in front of him.

